[statement]
Dependencies are walked in the order stated, not the order apk decides
them in: `v`, a name packages only provide, is stated first, so its
provider `p` comes before `z`, though apk decides `z` first.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:v z

P:p
V:1
p:v=1

P:z
V:1

[request]
a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p 1
install z 1
install a 1
